	"Description": "[size=4]我的所有Mod只发布在N网，一声不吭搬运到其他平台，可以但没必要噢。[/size]\n<br />\n<br />Inspired from the online game MapleStory.\n<br />\n<br />1.0.1\u00A0 Replace the Obsidian Edge's sprite.\n<br />1.0.2\u00A0 Add\u00A0 replacements\u00A0 for other three weapons.(Galaxy Dagger, Galaxy Hammer, Broken Trident)\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 Add the (SVE)Tempered Galaxy Sword's sprite.\n<br />-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 Add\u00A0 replacements for other two SVE weapons.（Galaxy Dagger, Galaxy Hammer），and now they can work with CP ：D\n<br />\n<br />1.0.3 add replacements for infinity weapons and golden scythe.\n<br />[size=3]\n<br />Want animation version？look [u][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5805]here\n<br />[/url][/u]Same style replacements for iridium tools. [u][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5851]here[/url][/u][/size]\n<br />\n<br />CP:\n<br />1.Download and extract the file.\n<br />2.Put the folder in \"Mods\".\n<br />3.You could open config.json to chose which replacement of golden scythe you want.（none=original, 1=type 1, 2=type 2）\n<br />\n<br />XNB:\n<br />1.Download and extract the file.\n<br />2.Put the file you want\u00A0 in \"&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;TileSheets\".\n<br />\n<br />SVE:\n<br />1.Download and extract the file.\n<br />2.Put the folder in \"Mods\".",
